                <invention-title lang="fr">AGRAFEUSE CHIRURGICALE À HAUTEUR D'AGRAFES AUTO-RÉGLABLE</invention-title>
                <invention-title lang="en">SURGICAL STAPLER WITH SELF-ADJUSTING STAPLE HEIGHT</invention-title>
            </bibliographic-data>
            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>A surgical stapler is provided that includes a spring loaded lift that automatically adjusts a staple cartridge and/or staple formation between a range of sizes. The lift is automatically released as the staple firing mechanism begins its forward translation of the firing sequence. The automatic one-way adjustment also adjusts the staple cartridge while maintaining the cartridge parallel to the anvil to provide consistent staple formations.</p>
            </abstract>
